# oracle: fix ave/moments with the start and history keywords and the raw input values (from examples/PACKAGES/moments/in.valtest on an LJ melt): mean variance skew kurtosis, start 5 and the history column (Nrepeat <= Nfreq)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units lj
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 0.8442
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
velocity all create 3.0 87287
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
fix 1 all nve
variable pe1 equal pe
fix 2 all ave/moments 1 4 5 v_pe1 mean variance skew kurtosis start 5 history 3
thermo_style custom step pe f_2[1] f_2[2] f_2[3] f_2[4] f_2[1][1] f_2[1][2] f_2[1][3]
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 5
run 60
